# Contributing

`main` holds the settled layout and the shared library. Paper work lands on `nb/<slug>` until it is ready to merge. Idea-stage work can use `feature/<slug>`.

Do not commit restricted extracts (`data/private/`, `data/local/`, `data/open/`) or generated artifacts under `results/`. READMEs and `.gitkeep` files under `results/` stay tracked.

Shared methods belong in [SymWorx](https://github.com/symworx/symworx). This repo keeps manuscripts, paper analysis, and loaders that every paper in the line uses.

